  - id: witness
    kind: 2
    title: The Watcher
    text: I saw your traveler cross the marsh behind a blue light. The reeds bent under their feet. The light did not stir them.
    continueLabel: Listen
    background: {fileID: 0}
    sceneLighting: {fileID: 0}
    foreground: {fileID: 0}
