  tablePresentation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85a75b59e31c4b169bddb725c4402002, type: 2}
  victoryTitle: What the watcher saw
  victoryText: The blue light went north along the causeway. Your traveler followed, calling to someone I could not see. Beyond the reeds, a moth keeps the fork. Ask what reached the other side.
  defeatTitle: Look again
  defeatText: There is more here than you have seen. Come back when you are ready to look again.
  abandonText: The watcher folds its wings and waits beside the empty chair.
  encounterCharmsIntroductionText: 
  resultContinueLabel: Return to the trail
  completionClueTitle: The northern causeway
  completionClueText: The traveler followed a blue light north along the causeway, calling to someone unseen. Find the moth at the fork beyond the reeds.
